# Save the game through its own system menu, under the name "ZZZZ".
#
# Used to anchor exploration: replaying the whole published route to reach a
# late room costs ~20 billion instructions and several minutes, so a probe
# that only wants to hover a new room saves once here and restores instead.
#
# System menu item centres, measured from the rendered menu:
#   Help 40  Save 56  Restore 72  Restart 88
#   Music/Voice 104  Status/Score 120  Quit 136  Cancel 152
# The menu is opened by the MAP/system button at (35,174); the dialogue's
# Ok button is at (65,168).

move 35 174
run 10
click left
run 40
move 160 56
run 10
click left
run 50
